    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "t_checks_body",
      "x": 360,
      "y": 108,
      "width": 337.5,
      "height": 324,
      "text": "1. sharedKey = oldPrivateKey × coordPubKey\n   (STARK curve scalar mul, verified in circuit)\n\n2. nullifier = Poseidon(oldPrivKey, pollId)\n   (prevents double registration)\n\n3. deactivateLeafHash =\n   Poseidon(c1Hash, c2Hash, sharedKeyHash)\n   (included in processDeactivate root)\n\n4. Merkle root == deactivateRootHash\n   (rebuild from leaf + path[0..3])\n\n5. (d1, d2) = rerandomize(\n     coordPubKey, c1, c2, randomVal)\n   (circuit recomputes and asserts equal)\n\n6. inputHash binds all public fields",
      "originalText": "1. sharedKey = oldPrivateKey × coordPubKey\n   (STARK curve scalar mul, verified in circuit)\n\n2. nullifier = Poseidon(oldPrivKey, pollId)\n   (prevents double registration)\n\n3. deactivateLeafHash =\n   Poseidon(c1Hash, c2Hash, sharedKeyHash)\n   (included in processDeactivate root)\n\n4. Merkle root == deactivateRootHash\n   (rebuild from leaf + path[0..3])\n\n5. (d1, d2) = rerandomize(\n     coordPubKey, c1, c2, randomVal)\n   (circuit recomputes and asserts equal)\n\n6. inputHash binds all public fields",
      "fontSize": 12,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "strokeColor": "#333333",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
